@* "Select all" and "Select none" for the checkboxes of the form around it. They need a script (organize.js), so they are
   hidden until it runs; without JavaScript the checkboxes are still there to check one by one. *@

<p class="bulk" data-bulk hidden>
    <button type="button" class="button secondary" data-select="all">@Text["Organize_SelectAll"]</button>
    <button type="button" class="button secondary" data-select="none">@Text["Organize_SelectNone"]</button>
</p>
